# Sources of the ice-water-gas origin study (hub 3.14). Commit messages are cited on the repository node as '#commit-<hash>'; line ranges sit in the citing claim.

n: 2.22
name: ice-water-gas-origin-sources
kind: hub
is: The primary sources behind hub 3.14: the study report; the Living Codex repository of 2025 with its first spec, phase engine, phase module, registry, tests and audit module; one spec of a sibling repository of 2026-02; eight files of the parent repository that define or bind the three words; twelve files of the old body that use them; and one private memory note. Commit messages of the old body and the parent repository are cited on 2.1 and 2.3.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 2.22.1
name: gap-ice-water-gas-origin.md
kind: source
is: The study report on the origin and definitions of ice, water and gas, 334 lines: a table of 22 uses, the owner's statements in date order, the conflicts, a proposed single definition and eight open questions.
path: coherence-seed/study/r2/gap-ice-water-gas-origin.md
date: 2026-11-24
got: 2026-11-24
at: 2026-11-24

